   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "The team plans the next version. We organize the work. Maria explains the DNS to me. I learn about the domain name because it is useful. Now I understand the label. I write a short note about the milestone. First Priya says, \"I'd like to check in.\" then I reply, \"I have a reservation.\" I understand a little more than yesterday.",
   "tts": "The team plans the next version. We organize the work. Maria explains the D N S to me. I learn about the domain name because it is useful. Now I understand the label. I write a short note about the milestone. First Priya says, \"I'd like to check in.\" then I reply, \"I have a reservation.\" I understand a little more than yesterday.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "团队在规划下一个版本。我们把工作整理归类。Maria 给我讲解域名系统。我学习域名，因为它很有用。现在我理解了标签。我给里程碑写了一条简短的笔记。先是Priya说：\"我想办理入住。\"然后我回答：\"我有预订。\"我比昨天多懂了一点。",
   "hard": [
    {
