  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Maria travels next week. She talks about her hotel. Leo says, \"Is breakfast included?\" so I answer, \"What time is checkout?\" Now I understand the web address. I write a short note about the URL. Leo shows me how to add a label. I remove a label one small step at a time. The team gives me good advice.",
   "tts": "Maria travels next week. She talks about her hotel. Leo says, \"Is breakfast included?\" so I answer, \"What time is checkout?\" Now I understand the web address. I write a short note about the U R L. Leo shows me how to add a label. I remove a label one small step at a time. The team gives me good advice.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "Maria 下周要出差。她聊起了她的酒店。Leo说：\"包含早餐吗？\"于是我回答：\"几点退房？\"现在我理解了网页地址。我给统一资源定位符写了一条简短的笔记。Leo 教我怎样添加标签。我一步一步地移除标签。团队给了我很好的建议。",
