  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I finish one last task. Maria explains the due date to me. I learn about the project board because it is useful. Now I understand the subdomain. I resolve a domain carefully. First Priya says, \"Could I get another towel?\" then I reply, \"Can you store my luggage?\" Every issue now has a label and a due date.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I finish one last task. Maria explains the due date to me. I learn about the project board because it is useful. Now I understand the subdomain. I resolve a domain carefully. First Priya says, \"Could I get another towel?\" then I reply, \"Can you store my luggage?\" Every issue now has a label and a due date.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我完成最后一项任务。Maria 给我讲解截止日期。我学习项目看板，因为它很有用。现在我理解了子域名。我认真地解析域名。先是Priya说：\"可以再给我一条毛巾吗？\"然后我回答：\"你们能寄存我的行李吗？\"现在每个问题单都有了标签和截止日期。",
